cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use LaserPerception, cite LaserPerception v0.4.0 and, where reproducibility matters, the
  exact commit used.
type: software
title: LaserPerception
version: 0.4.0
date-released: 2026-09-22
authors:
  - given-names: Mahad
    family-names: Azher
    alias: muhammadmahadazher
repository-code: https://github.com/muhammadmahadazher/laserperception
url: https://github.com/muhammadmahadazher/laserperception
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  An open-source, CPU-first 3D LiDAR perception and deployment-engineering toolkit with explicit
  data and model contracts, deterministic tracking, semantic-result evaluation, reproducible
  detector evidence, ROS 2 integration, and guarded external GPU execution.
keywords:
  - LiDAR
  - point cloud
  - 3D object detection
  - PointPillars
  - nuScenes
  - TensorRT
  - ROS 2
  - multi-object tracking
  - semantic evaluation
